  "\"Apple\", in Japanese": "日文的「苹果」",
  "A name that asks a question": "一个本身就是问句的名字",
  "Somebody out there is looking for apples. Most people just call me <em>Ringo</em>.": "总有人在找苹果。大多数人直接叫我 <em>Ringo</em>。",
  "Chapter": "章节",
  "2017 — 2024 / Minecraft": "2017 — 2024 / Minecraft",
  "Built a national railway": "为一个不存在的国家，",
  "for a country that": "盖了一整条",
  "doesn't exist.": "国营铁路。",
  "On the Ringo MRT Server, a group of friends and I founded the Republic of Ringo, and inside it, the National Ringo Railway Corporation. I built stations, and wired them with redstone and command blocks until minecarts dispatched, stopped and opened platform screen doors on their own.": "在苹果地铁服务器（Ringo MRT Server）上，我和一群网友成立了虚拟国度「Republic of Ringo」，并在其中创立国立苹果铁路股份有限公司（NRRC）。我负责盖车站，再用红石和指令方块把它们串起来，直到矿车能自己发车、停靠、打开屏蔽门。",
  "Architecture": "建筑",
