  "Rebuilt Papers, Please": "在 Scratch 里",
  "in Scratch.": "重做了 Papers, Please。",
  "My school sent me to a city-wide competition. I brought a border-checkpoint game inspired by Papers, Please, and came home with a Merit Award from New Taipei City.": "学校推派我参加全市竞赛。我带着一款致敬 Papers, Please 的边境检查游戏出赛，拿下新北市优等。",
  "Game design": "游戏设计",
  "Merit Award": "优等",
  "2018 — now / TWERG": "2018 — 现在 / TWERG",
  "\"Can I add you": "「可以加你",
  "on Discord?\"": "Discord 吗？」",
  "One question in an earthquake livestream chat turned into the Taiwan Earthquake Recording Group. Eight years later it is a community of 10,000 people. I built its website, its heavy rain warning map and its DYFI intensity algorithm: JavaScript and CSS on the front, Python to train and check the math, Cloudflare to keep it online.": "在地震直播聊天室里问的一句话，成立了地牛记录小组。八年后成长为了一万人的社区，网站、暴雨特报地图、DYFI 体感烈度算法都由我打造：前端用 JavaScript 与 CSS，用 Python 训练与验证算法，部署在 Cloudflare 上。",
  "Founder": "创办人",
  "10,000 members": "一万名成员",
  "VRChat / Xiaomi 14 Ultra": "VRChat / Xiaomi 14 Ultra",
  "Learned to see": "在不存在的世界里，",
  "in worlds that": "学会了",
  "don't exist.": "怎么看。",
  "I could not take a photo until I started shooting inside VRChat. Frame after virtual frame taught me photography by subtraction: take things away until only the point remains. Now I reach for long lenses to find what the naked eye walks past.": "我原本不会拍照，直到开始在 VRChat 里拍。一张又一张虚拟画面，教会我「删去法」：把多余的拿掉，直到只剩重点。现在我偏爱长焦，去找肉眼会错过的东西。",
  "Composition by subtraction": "删去法构图",
  "Enter Focal Length": "进入「焦段」",
  "In development / Unity": "开发中 / Unity",
  "Two siblings.": "一对兄妹。",
