  "Pink is my favorite color. Kuromi is my favorite character. Both are non-negotiable.": "最喜欢的颜色是粉红色，最喜欢的角色是库洛米。这两件事没得商量。",
  "\"Sensitive, and careful with details.\" A school counselor said it first. The numbers in my galgame agree.": "「感性，而且心思细腻。」这是咨商心理师先说的。我 galgame 里的数值也同意该观点。",
  "A plush doll beside a rose in a silver vase": "银色花瓶里的玫瑰旁，坐着一只布偶",
