  "What the replay taught me": "模拟教会我的事",
  "Direction fixes <em>where</em> the shaking goes, not <em>how big</em> the earthquake is.": "方向修正的是摇晃<em>往哪里去</em>，不是地震<em>有多大</em>。",
  "In Hualien the first magnitude was close, and correcting direction turned three missed strong-shaking cities into none. In Chishang and Nanxi the first magnitude was off, and correcting direction alone could not close the gap. For Nanxi it even pushed an already high estimate higher. That is the next problem to solve.": "花莲的第一报震级很接近，修正方向后，三个漏报的高烈度城市全部补了回来。池上和楠西的第一报震级本身就估错了，只修正方向补不回这个差距；楠西甚至把原本就偏高的估计推得更高。这就是下一个要解决的问题。",
